# MatchVaga Design System

Design tokens and components are defined in the rules below. All tokens live in `globals.css`; components follow the catalog in `design-components.mdc`.

## Rule Index

| Rule | Content |
|------|---------|
| `design-tokens-reference.mdc` | Colors, typography, spacing, radius, layout. All in `globals.css`. |
| `design-components.mdc` | Component catalog, UX principles, shadcn usage. |
| `tailwind-no-arbitrary.mdc` | No arbitrary Tailwind values in components. |

When adding design components or changing tokens, update the relevant rule and `globals.css` accordingly.
